      "reason": "Move integrity checks toward a validated diagnostic test suite. Seek executable sampler provenance and deliberately injected defects that establish which probes detect target leakage, incorrect left-padding readout, mask misalignment, and predictor mismatch. Synthetic controls should validate probe sensitivity without being mistaken for certification of the actual pipeline.",
      "query": "BERT4Rec masked sequential recommendation diagnostic mutation testing metamorphic testing target leakage sampler provenance training inference consistency 2024 2025 2026"
    },
    {
      "reason": "Connect observed history sensitivity to specific components of the single trained BERT4Rec network. Seek feasible activation-patching and layer-ablation methods, with random-patch controls and intervention-fidelity checks, to distinguish content dependence, position effects, and embedding-frequency shortcuts. Training-prefix effects must remain separate from held-out usefulness.",
      "query": "sequential recommendation transformer mechanistic interpretability activation patching layer ablation positional embeddings popularity shortcuts intervention faithfulness 2024 2025 2026"
    },
    {
      "reason": "Turn qualitative skips into auditable failure measurements using supplied titles, descriptions, histories, and explicitly recorded feedback. Seek evidence-linked annotation rubrics separating redundancy, explicit specification conflicts, unsupported assumptions, and insufficient relevance evidence; validate agreement and abstention on the twenty feedback users. Missing ownership or specifications must remain unknown, and these diagnostics must not become an additional inference scorer.",
      "query": "recommendation feedback grounded error taxonomy redundancy compatibility insufficient evidence selective prediction annotation reliability small sample 2024 2025 2026"
    }
  ]
